#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:9
#, no-c-format
msgid "mailto"
msgstr "mailto"

#. Tag: author
#: index.docbook:12
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<firstname>Christopher</firstname> <surname>Yeleighton</surname> "
"<email>giecrilj@stegny.2a.pl</email>"
msgstr ""
"<firstname>Christopher</firstname> <surname>Yeleighton</surname> "
"<email>giecrilj@stegny.2a.pl</email>"

#. Tag: trans_comment
#: index.docbook:17
#, no-c-format
msgid "ROLES_OF_TRANSLATORS"
msgstr "ULOGE_PREVODIOCA"

#. Tag: date
#: index.docbook:20
#, no-c-format
msgid "2012-01-28"
msgstr "2012-01-28"

#. Tag: releaseinfo
#: index.docbook:21
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kde; 4.8"
msgstr "&kde; 4.8"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:23
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The kioslave mailto is responsible for launching the mail composer of your "
"choice when you open a &URL; in the mailto scheme (<ulink url=\"http://tools."
"ietf.org/html/rfc6068\">RFC6068</ulink>)."
msgstr ""
"Kioslave mailto je odgovoran za lanisranje mail komposera vašeg izbora kada "
"otvorite &URL; u mailto šemi (<ulink url=\"http://tools.ietf.org/html/"
"rfc6068\">RFC6068</ulink>)."

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:30
#, no-c-format
msgid "Syntax"
msgstr "Sintaksa"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:31
#, no-c-format
msgid "The syntax of a mailto &URL; follows the following pattern:"
msgstr "Sintaksa mailto-a &URL; prati sljedeći obrazac:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:33
#, no-c-format
msgid "mailto:recipients?query"
msgstr "mailto:primaoci?pitanje"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:35
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"where recipients form a list of restricted &SMTP; address specifications, "
"and the query part may contain one or more of the following parameters:"
msgstr ""
"gdje primaoci formiraju listu o restriktovanim &SMTP; specifikacija adresa, "
"i dio pitanja sadrži jedan ili više sljedećih parametara:"

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:40
#, no-c-format
msgid "&amp;to=recipients"
msgstr "&amp;to=primaoci"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:41
#, no-c-format
msgid "Specifies additional recipients."
msgstr "Specifira dodate primaoce."

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:45
#, no-c-format
msgid "&amp;cc=recipients"
msgstr "&amp;cc=primaoci"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:46
#, no-c-format
msgid "Specifies additional recipients of carbon copies."
msgstr "Specifira dodatne primaoce karbon kopija."

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:50
#, no-c-format
msgid "&amp;bcc=recipients"
msgstr "&amp;bcc=primaoci"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:51
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Specifies additional recipients of blind carbon copies. These recipients "
"will receive the message, but all other recipients will not know about that."
msgstr ""
"Specifira dodate primaoce slijepih karbon kopija. Ovi primaoci će primiti "
"poruku, ali ostali primaoci neće znati ništa o tome."

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:56
#, no-c-format
msgid "&amp;body=text"
msgstr "&amp;tijelo=tekst"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:57
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Specifies the text of the message. This text should not be long, as there "
"may be hard limits on how long an &URL; may be."
msgstr ""
"Specifira određen tekst poruke. Ovaj tekst ne bi trebao biti dug, jer bi "
"mogao biti limit na koliko dug &URL; može biti."

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:62
#, no-c-format
msgid "&amp;subject=text"
msgstr "&amp;subject=tekst"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:63
#, no-c-format
msgid "Specifies the subject of the message."
msgstr "Specifira određeni predmet u poruci."

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:72
#, no-c-format
msgid "Example"
msgstr "Primjer"

#. Tag: literal
#: index.docbook:74
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"mailto:info@kde.org?cc=kde@kde.org&amp;subject=Thank%20you!&amp;body=KDE"
"%20rocks!%20How%20can%20I%20help%3F"
msgstr ""
"mailto:info@kde.org?cc=kde@kde.org&amp;subject=Thank%20you!&amp;body=KDE"
"%20rocks!%20How%20can%20I%20help%3F"

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:79
#, no-c-format
msgid "Configuration"
msgstr "Postavke"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:80
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Choose the application to handle mailto locators in &systemsettings; "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Workspace Appearance and Behaviour</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Default Applications</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Izaberite aplikaciju da rukuje mailto lokatorima u &systemsettings; "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Workspace Izgled i ponašanje</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Default Applications</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
